  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of workers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CPO will support Tajikistan Federation of Independent Trade Unions (FITUT) in development of a proposal for a new Tripartite General Agreement with the Government and Employer Organizations which will include an output on improving compliance of multinational enterprises with International Labour Standards and the ILO Declaration on Multinational Enterprises and Social Policy (MNE). The proposal will integrate issues on addressing decent work deficits through formalization of informal employment in supply chains, improvement of workers access to social protection system and promotion of gender equality and non-discrimination aspects.</narrative>
  </description>
